This package calls the Windows COM runtime (ole32.dll, oleaut32.dll) through node-ctypes.
It does not distribute any Windows component.

Its API and design are modelled on Python comtypes, distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/enthought/comtypes
https://github.com/enthought/comtypes/blob/main/LICENSE.txt

No comtypes source code is included. Interface definitions follow the Windows SDK
headers and the Microsoft documentation:
https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/com/
